WEBVTT

00:00:04.830 --> 00:00:09.670
The following program is intended for mature audiences
and contains Adult Content, Graphic Language,

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:14.760
Graphic Violence, Brief Nudity and
Strong Sexual Content including rape.

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:44.960
Identify yourself.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:49.090
Rokki.

00:00:58.300 --> 00:00:59.560
Impossible.

00:01:00.720 --> 00:01:03.270
With such a long sword?

00:01:07.020 --> 00:01:09.770
What kind of sword is this...?

00:01:14.610 --> 00:01:15.780
Rokki?

00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:31.000
Where, and what exactly went mad?

00:01:34.470 --> 00:01:35.300
Ryo!

00:01:37.890 --> 00:01:39.680
Lord Habaki!

00:01:39.760 --> 00:01:43.310
You need no longer address me with useless titles.

00:01:45.180 --> 00:01:47.390
I am glad, Father.

00:01:49.770 --> 00:01:52.320
My father was born a militant man.

00:01:52.400 --> 00:01:56.400
Thus, in order to elevate his status
in this era of peace,

00:01:56.490 --> 00:01:59.700
he would take up his sword
as an assassin for the Shogunate.

00:02:05.910 --> 00:02:08.620
Blade of the Immortal

00:02:08.710 --> 00:02:11.040
One, two, three

00:02:12.500 --> 00:02:15.340
Undead tree

00:02:15.420 --> 00:02:17.760
What truth

00:02:19.010 --> 00:02:21.430
I'll come true

00:02:23.640 --> 00:02:28.600
Wow

00:02:29.310 --> 00:02:32.480
I see that bright light

00:02:34.440 --> 00:02:38.860
This is all I have

00:02:39.570 --> 00:02:43.370
What did you say?
I know

00:02:44.160 --> 00:02:47.910
Why do you say?

00:02:49.420 --> 00:02:53.590
Hone the blade
Lie around

00:02:53.670 --> 00:03:00.300
Survive of vision
Death and pleasure are my future

00:03:00.760 --> 00:03:04.640
I got lost
I was lost

00:03:04.930 --> 00:03:08.390
Survive of vision

00:03:08.480 --> 00:03:11.690
Unfinished heaven

00:03:11.900 --> 00:03:15.440
Now fight to claim your wounds

00:03:15.770 --> 00:03:19.190
Don't know why
Don't know why

00:03:19.820 --> 00:03:23.990
Survive of vision

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:37.170
Stain your hands with blood even once,

00:03:37.250 --> 00:03:40.300
and fate will bring it right back to your door.

00:03:44.680 --> 00:03:45.800
Mitake...

00:03:45.890 --> 00:03:48.560
Yes sir. Meguro, Tanpopo.

00:03:48.640 --> 00:03:49.480
-Right.
-Right.

00:03:51.890 --> 00:03:53.730
That man is Sukezane Baro.

00:03:53.810 --> 00:03:56.480
Another vice-captain, Sosuke Abayama.

00:03:56.570 --> 00:03:59.030
Of the same title, Taito Magatsu.

00:03:59.110 --> 00:04:02.030
And the leader, Kagehisa Anotsu.

00:04:02.110 --> 00:04:08.290
These four, along with five of unknown origins,
together comprise the Itto-ryu at present.

00:04:09.830 --> 00:04:14.790
I am the leader of the Rokki-dan,
Kagimura Habaki.

00:04:14.880 --> 00:04:19.460
The other day I received the order to take my own life.

00:04:19.550 --> 00:04:24.550
For better or for worse, I will pursue the Itto-ryu
for 30 more days.

00:04:24.640 --> 00:04:30.180
And when 30 days have passed,
if Kagehisa Anotsu yet lives,

00:04:30.270 --> 00:04:33.520
all of you will be again condemned to death.

00:04:34.810 --> 00:04:38.320
You shall hunt a cornered animal
as cornered animals.

00:04:38.400 --> 00:04:41.190
Or else be bitten yourselves.

00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:45.660
In this, you and them are of equal fortune.

00:04:45.740 --> 00:04:47.780
You may express your gratitude.

00:05:02.550 --> 00:05:05.720
I am the head of the Itto-ryu, Kagehisa Anotsu.

00:05:05.800 --> 00:05:08.100
I appreciate you all coming so far.

00:05:08.180 --> 00:05:13.600
Our hearts have been Itto-ryu
since the moment we found the Itto-ryu.

00:05:13.680 --> 00:05:17.190
If it ever please you, we would offer our lives.

00:05:18.690 --> 00:05:22.780
My lord, allow us once more
to bear the honor of the name Itto-ryu.

00:05:24.150 --> 00:05:27.910
The question of their numbers presents itself.

00:05:27.990 --> 00:05:29.700
Or so I would reckon.

00:05:29.780 --> 00:05:31.450
That is no problem.

00:05:31.540 --> 00:05:34.370
Prepare them thoroughly alongside Baro.

00:05:34.830 --> 00:05:36.460
This is truly where it begins.

00:05:36.870 --> 00:05:40.130
Will we have satisfaction against the Shogunate?

00:05:40.710 --> 00:05:43.010
What are you hoping to do, master?

00:05:44.090 --> 00:05:45.050
Magatsu...

00:05:46.510 --> 00:05:47.470
It's time we ran wild.

00:05:49.930 --> 00:05:53.470
Tatsu, could you go fill this pot with water?

00:05:53.560 --> 00:05:55.640
Sure, water it is.

00:05:55.730 --> 00:05:58.940
Yeah. You can fill it to the... sixth...

00:06:01.820 --> 00:06:02.730
Sorry.

00:06:04.070 --> 00:06:08.280
It's been half a month since Tatsu was wed,
but I'm not quite used to it.

00:06:08.700 --> 00:06:11.870
If you got used to it in half a month,
Tatsu would be sad.

00:06:11.950 --> 00:06:13.660
Good morning, sir!

00:06:14.330 --> 00:06:15.700
-We're coming in.
-They're here.

00:06:15.790 --> 00:06:16.960
Are you sure we should?

00:06:17.040 --> 00:06:20.460
-Shut up. No pushing, piggy.
-I'm not pushing.

00:06:21.540 --> 00:06:23.130
Rin! Hello.

00:06:23.840 --> 00:06:24.710
She's here.

00:06:24.800 --> 00:06:28.510
Sir, we brought the sketches you asked for.

00:06:28.590 --> 00:06:30.930
Thanks. You work quick.

00:06:31.350 --> 00:06:33.510
We're looking forward to today's lesson.

00:06:33.600 --> 00:06:35.220
Sir, is there anything you need?

00:06:41.060 --> 00:06:43.690
Is she a prostitute? Or a performer?

00:06:45.570 --> 00:06:46.990
Do not mind her.

00:06:49.200 --> 00:06:51.030
In place of Kagimura Habaki,

00:06:51.120 --> 00:06:55.990
I, Ugen Hanabusa, will be taking over his duties
as head officer.

00:06:56.500 --> 00:06:58.710
I'll get straight to the point.

00:06:59.620 --> 00:07:02.630
I'd like the Itto-ryu to leave Edo.

00:07:03.590 --> 00:07:07.550
Or we can continue to destroy all of you by force.

00:07:07.800 --> 00:07:13.100
Though, taking on the Itto-ryu
would spread unwanted chaos through the town,

00:07:13.180 --> 00:07:16.310
and lives of civilians would be lost in vain.

00:07:16.390 --> 00:07:21.900
The Fukiage incident was
the result of Kagimura Habaki's failure.

00:07:21.980 --> 00:07:26.230
The elders decided this upon expulsion from Edo.

00:07:26.730 --> 00:07:29.900
Mister Anotsu. Will you heed it or not?

00:07:31.410 --> 00:07:32.820
If I said not?

00:07:33.490 --> 00:07:39.500
Were that the case, all 12 companies
of the new guard would commence hostilities

00:07:39.580 --> 00:07:41.500
with the Itto-ryu.

00:07:42.540 --> 00:07:44.540
We would rather avoid becoming violent.

00:07:46.920 --> 00:07:50.010
All you need do is nod your head.

00:07:50.670 --> 00:07:54.760
Even if you managed to escape, the woman behind you...

00:08:03.230 --> 00:08:04.190
Mister Hanabusa.

00:08:05.060 --> 00:08:07.650
I'd like these four to sheathe their blades.

00:08:08.190 --> 00:08:10.940
My mind is already made.

00:08:11.240 --> 00:08:12.450
Then you'll...?

00:08:12.530 --> 00:08:16.120
I will humbly accept your request.

00:08:17.490 --> 00:08:19.370
So when will you be gone?

00:08:19.910 --> 00:08:22.410
Preparations will be finished within seven days.

00:08:23.830 --> 00:08:27.290
So I'd really appreciate it
if you let him stay in my room.

00:08:27.460 --> 00:08:30.090
-Rin's brought back a man!
-I haven't really heard a reason...

00:08:30.170 --> 00:08:32.760
What a terrifying little girl.

00:08:34.470 --> 00:08:35.590
I'm putting out the light.

00:08:48.480 --> 00:08:49.520
Hey.

00:08:52.030 --> 00:08:54.070
Lately in my dreams,

00:08:54.450 --> 00:08:57.820
I've been seeing the scene
where we reunited in Kaga.

00:08:58.660 --> 00:09:00.910
What was it about that day?

00:09:01.410 --> 00:09:03.120
I guess I'd call it special.

00:09:04.410 --> 00:09:08.000
I was both terribly happy and sad.

00:09:09.960 --> 00:09:12.800
That's the last way I want to feel about it.

00:09:16.010 --> 00:09:17.220
In the past,

00:09:17.300 --> 00:09:21.930
my foolishness led me to destroy the life
of a girl that was precious to me.

00:09:26.140 --> 00:09:29.980
I've had enough... of those memories.

00:09:32.530 --> 00:09:33.690
Mr. Manji...

00:09:34.400 --> 00:09:35.400
Do I...

00:09:36.660 --> 00:09:37.910
I...

00:09:39.620 --> 00:09:41.240
Do I still...

00:09:42.120 --> 00:09:44.250
remind you of your little sister?

00:09:48.880 --> 00:09:49.710
No.

00:10:15.110 --> 00:10:18.360
Through the work of the new head officer
Ugen Hanabusa,

00:10:18.700 --> 00:10:21.280
the Itto-ryu's banishment from Edo was decided.

00:10:21.740 --> 00:10:26.120
It was the will of the elders,
and they had seven days to capitulate.

00:10:26.200 --> 00:10:30.460
Exceeding this, the Rokki-dan had been ordered
to bring the matter to a close.

00:10:30.920 --> 00:10:33.710
The Rokki-dan were all formerly sentenced to death.

00:10:33.800 --> 00:10:38.130
And though he may be my father, he cannot
be banished from Edo on Hanabusa's account.

00:10:38.970 --> 00:10:41.800
Furthermore, Ugen Hanabusa
took hostages to ensure a foolproof plan.

00:10:41.890 --> 00:10:44.010
Please wait until my lord has returned!

00:10:44.470 --> 00:10:45.850
Out of the way!

00:10:45.930 --> 00:10:47.520
As the direct retainer of Mikawa,

00:10:48.100 --> 00:10:51.360
even though he has been dismissed from his duties,

00:10:51.440 --> 00:10:56.070
this is discourtesy to the House of
Habaki, which has been honored with valor.

00:10:58.820 --> 00:10:59.650
Wait!

00:11:01.370 --> 00:11:02.280
And who are you?

00:11:02.370 --> 00:11:04.490
I may have been only a concubine's daughter,

00:11:04.910 --> 00:11:09.290
but I truly regarded my lords
Madam Shima and Sir Sakutaro as family.

00:11:19.420 --> 00:11:20.840
Back, you curs!

00:11:23.140 --> 00:11:26.260
Can't you see you're making this worse?

00:11:32.350 --> 00:11:34.190
Now, gentlemen...

00:11:34.610 --> 00:11:36.400
There is no sense in disrespecting

00:11:36.480 --> 00:11:39.690
the wife of the Shogun's vassal
if you are under Shogunate orders.

00:11:40.780 --> 00:11:43.120
Now, wherever it may be,

00:11:43.200 --> 00:11:45.330
I bid you take me there.

00:12:01.930 --> 00:12:04.010
So Shima and Sakutaro

00:12:04.090 --> 00:12:06.760
are inside Hanabusa's manor?

00:12:06.850 --> 00:12:10.140
They did not appear to have been handled roughly.

00:12:10.230 --> 00:12:11.690
Let's rescue them.

00:12:11.770 --> 00:12:12.600
No.

00:12:12.690 --> 00:12:17.360
I would not mobilize you over a matter so trivial
as the peril of my kin.

00:12:17.440 --> 00:12:22.200
We Rokki-dan may be criminals,
but we are not traitors.

00:12:22.280 --> 00:12:26.200
We will smoke out Kagehisa Anotsu by the seventh.

00:12:30.870 --> 00:12:32.290
The seven days was the limit.

00:12:32.620 --> 00:12:38.500
To track down the Itto-ryu,
the Rokki-dan first tortured the son of Sosuke Abayama.

00:12:40.710 --> 00:12:41.880
Then...

00:12:44.180 --> 00:12:46.850
we discovered Sukezane Baro's former fiancé.

00:12:47.430 --> 00:12:50.970
At first, she pretended to be an opium addict...

00:12:54.390 --> 00:12:56.650
I have to get to Sir Sukezane right away!

00:12:59.320 --> 00:13:04.110
It was clear she was still connected with Baro
and was also put to torture.

00:13:05.780 --> 00:13:08.740
The battle with the Itto-ryu had already begun.

00:13:08.830 --> 00:13:10.490
My father was out of time.

00:13:10.580 --> 00:13:13.620
It is the way of a warrior family
to exhaust all its strength in battle.

00:13:13.710 --> 00:13:14.620
YUKIMACHI

00:13:14.710 --> 00:13:16.880
The methods need not be questioned.

00:13:18.710 --> 00:13:23.170
In the end, Sukezane Baro's former fiance
killed herself during torture.

00:13:24.510 --> 00:13:29.680
Without any leads,
we paid a visit to the burnt down Itto-ryu Tenpo dojo.

00:13:30.760 --> 00:13:32.770
According to the magistrate's inspection,

00:13:32.850 --> 00:13:37.350
not a single corpse
of anyone Itto-ryu in appearance was found.

00:13:37.480 --> 00:13:40.320
Meaning, they set the fire themselves?

00:13:40.650 --> 00:13:42.570
Why would they do that?

00:13:42.650 --> 00:13:46.150
Fancying the place useless does not amount
to a reason.

00:13:46.700 --> 00:13:50.330
But if perhaps it were a distraction...

00:13:50.990 --> 00:13:54.250
They had hidden it well, but just as father said,

00:13:54.330 --> 00:13:57.920
we finally found a trap door leading underground.

00:14:01.920 --> 00:14:03.460
It looks pretty deep.

00:14:04.510 --> 00:14:05.590
Let's keep moving.

00:14:10.890 --> 00:14:12.100
Stay on guard.

00:14:13.060 --> 00:14:14.310
Ready your swords.

00:14:19.270 --> 00:14:20.360
What's this?

00:14:20.980 --> 00:14:22.440
An underground dojo?

00:14:28.700 --> 00:14:31.070
-There's one!
-It's one of the Itto-ryu!

00:14:31.160 --> 00:14:32.530
Hey! Illuminate him!

00:14:32.620 --> 00:14:33.740
What? He's run off!

00:14:33.830 --> 00:14:34.950
Well of course he did!

00:14:35.040 --> 00:14:35.910
After him!

00:14:40.670 --> 00:14:42.500
It's no good.

00:14:42.590 --> 00:14:44.210
It's been barred.

00:14:45.420 --> 00:14:47.920
-Do it, Amon.
-Yes sir.

00:14:54.350 --> 00:14:56.140
Something comes.

00:14:56.220 --> 00:15:00.980
Get underground quickly,
and call off the search!

00:15:01.060 --> 00:15:02.440
What? Yes sir!

00:15:05.440 --> 00:15:08.400
Devoured by flame and swallowed by water.

00:15:08.490 --> 00:15:11.620
Goodbye, Itto-ryu Tenpo dojo.

00:15:27.340 --> 00:15:31.220
The Itto-ryu aren't here! Search outside the perimeter!

00:15:31.930 --> 00:15:33.430
Lord Habaki, the gates!

00:15:39.020 --> 00:15:41.480
They've covered the gates with oil.

00:15:41.560 --> 00:15:45.440
Some black varnish made of a charcoal
and paste mix?

00:15:45.520 --> 00:15:49.320
So it would be misidentified
as burn damage from afar...

00:15:51.490 --> 00:15:53.240
Come now, Sir Habaki.

00:15:53.320 --> 00:15:56.240
When it comes to traps,
we dare not spare an expense.

00:15:58.910 --> 00:15:59.950
Fire.

00:16:18.720 --> 00:16:20.810
-You!
-Leave it, Katsumata!

00:16:20.890 --> 00:16:23.900
No Itto-ryu would falter before one little girl!

00:16:30.570 --> 00:16:32.860
Idiot, you earned that one.

00:16:32.950 --> 00:16:35.280
-Mr. Magatsu!
-If there's no other way,

00:16:35.370 --> 00:16:37.080
I'll entertain you for a moment or two.

00:16:39.160 --> 00:16:42.040
Taito Magatsu, the Itto-ryu vice-captain.

00:16:43.330 --> 00:16:45.210
If you won't budge, I will!

00:16:52.630 --> 00:16:53.760
You gave me a shock.

00:16:59.600 --> 00:17:02.140
You're faster than my recruits.

00:17:03.140 --> 00:17:05.150
If you see Habaki, tell him...

00:17:06.350 --> 00:17:09.070
that this is no fight to be won in seven days.

00:17:10.070 --> 00:17:12.280
He should show a little grit.

00:17:28.040 --> 00:17:28.960
Ryo.

00:17:29.920 --> 00:17:30.750
Yes...

00:17:31.590 --> 00:17:33.880
The Itto-ryu are strong, aren't they?

00:17:35.340 --> 00:17:36.180
Yes.

00:17:40.970 --> 00:17:41.810
Yes.

00:17:58.910 --> 00:18:03.910
Have you heard the saying,
"A great harvest costs greater opportunity"?

00:18:04.000 --> 00:18:05.080
No.

00:18:05.160 --> 00:18:09.130
A great tree can be too much to put to proper use.

00:18:09.210 --> 00:18:13.920
A man's high caliber
may be deemed unusable to the world.

00:18:14.010 --> 00:18:15.840
That's a verse from Du Fu's poetry.

00:18:16.550 --> 00:18:19.180
Itto-ryu, Kagehisa Anotsu,

00:18:19.260 --> 00:18:23.640
and Kagimura Habaki are people of that nature,
I am sure.

00:18:24.680 --> 00:18:26.230
But I'm different.

00:18:29.150 --> 00:18:32.270
Where, and what exactly went mad?

00:18:35.530 --> 00:18:36.360
Dear...

00:18:37.780 --> 00:18:39.820
Shima, Sakutaro...

00:18:41.490 --> 00:18:44.330
Gather all of the Rokki-dan here at once!

00:18:45.040 --> 00:18:48.410
From here on, their lives are my responsibility,

00:18:48.500 --> 00:18:51.840
that I might deliver the condemned
to the jailor once more.

00:18:54.050 --> 00:18:55.840
Now, Sir Habaki.

00:18:56.170 --> 00:18:58.470
Will you surrender the Rokki or not?

00:19:01.720 --> 00:19:03.510
Mitake, tell the Rokki--

00:19:03.600 --> 00:19:05.180
Please wait, my dear.

00:19:06.350 --> 00:19:09.060
Allow me to speak with him for a moment.

00:19:09.350 --> 00:19:11.770
What? Well, I suppose...

00:19:13.110 --> 00:19:14.230
Father.

00:19:14.940 --> 00:19:19.530
I have something I must apologize for at length.

00:19:20.280 --> 00:19:26.910
What I'm most sorry about
is that I didn't inherit your talent with swords.

00:19:28.410 --> 00:19:30.000
I was lost.

00:19:30.960 --> 00:19:33.170
Could I even live pridefully as your son

00:19:33.250 --> 00:19:36.170
if no matter how hard I tried, swordplay eluded me?

00:19:36.750 --> 00:19:40.590
But I simply could not grasp it.

00:19:42.220 --> 00:19:43.600
So at the very least,

00:19:43.680 --> 00:19:46.010
I wanted to live in a way

00:19:46.470 --> 00:19:51.100
that didn't interfere with your job
or make me an obstacle on the path you had chosen.

00:19:53.730 --> 00:19:57.940
You have a family I was unaware of, yes?

00:19:58.030 --> 00:20:01.070
When the guards came to the manor,

00:20:01.150 --> 00:20:04.410
the Soma girl jumped in to save us.

00:20:04.870 --> 00:20:09.120
That girl is of your bloodline, is she not?

00:20:11.460 --> 00:20:12.620
It's true.

00:20:13.210 --> 00:20:15.790
Please give that girl...

00:20:17.050 --> 00:20:18.550
my word of thanks.

00:20:24.470 --> 00:20:25.390
Shima!

00:20:25.470 --> 00:20:30.770
Dear, I will fulfill my duty
as the wife of Kagimura Habaki.

00:20:31.730 --> 00:20:36.520
Please fulfill the duty of being
Kagimura Habaki to its end.

00:20:37.480 --> 00:20:39.690
I have loved you,

00:20:39.780 --> 00:20:42.360
-my dear.
-Shima!

00:20:59.380 --> 00:21:01.210
Once we've prepared...

00:21:02.970 --> 00:21:06.090
we will pursue the Itto-ryu with the Rokki.

00:21:06.340 --> 00:21:09.060
Sir Habaki... That...

00:21:09.140 --> 00:21:11.980
Twenty days until my seppuku...

00:21:12.640 --> 00:21:16.440
If I have not caught Kagehisa Anotsu by then,

00:21:16.850 --> 00:21:19.980
I will execute each of the Rokki with my own hands

00:21:20.070 --> 00:21:23.280
and carry their heads back to you.

00:21:24.070 --> 00:21:28.070
And, whether Kagehisa Anotsu is defeated or not,

00:21:28.160 --> 00:21:31.830
I will return to Edo to take my own life.

00:21:34.250 --> 00:21:35.750
But...

00:21:38.710 --> 00:21:42.630
If even that is to your disliking, then so be it.

00:21:42.710 --> 00:21:47.470
As the new head officer,
you had best come after me.

00:21:47.550 --> 00:21:51.180
However, when that time comes,

00:21:51.260 --> 00:21:54.310
you better put your life on the line.

00:22:05.740 --> 00:22:07.160
Lord Hanabusa...

00:22:12.540 --> 00:22:13.490
The Rokki-dan.

